1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,480
What if you enter the Marvel universe with zero powers.

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:06,560
Week one, your apartment gets smashed in a hero fight.

3
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:07,420
Who pays for it?

4
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:08,480
Not the heroes.

5
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:13,480
Cities get wrecked so often there, they literally have a cleanup company called Damage Control.

6
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,400
Then aliens invade New York.

7
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:15,940
Again.

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:16,960
You're not the hero.

9
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:19,520
You're the guy running in the background, screaming.

10
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,840
And then a purple guy snaps his fingers.

11
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,160
Half of all life disappears.

12
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:24,880
Coin flip.

13
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:25,880
Heads, you stay.

14
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,020
Tails, you're dust.

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:27,920
Survive that?

16
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:28,600
Congrats.

17
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,780
Five years later, everyone comes back…

18
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,420
and your landlord wants five years of rent.

19
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:36,320
Send this to the friend who says they'd totally be an Avenger.

20
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,100
They wouldn't survive week one.

21
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:39,220
Want a real superpower?

22
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:39,960
Subscribe.

23
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,540
It's the only button here that never gets snapped.
